      "start_seconds": 34.24,
      "end_seconds": 42.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "A eight out of ten, I suppose. I'd been feeling like I have flu, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.55,
      "end_seconds": 61.2,
