      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.81,
      "end_seconds": 226.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "You are breathing a little deeply and fast and your mouth is dry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.93,
      "end_seconds": 229.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.82,
      "end_seconds": 243.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.48,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. So where does that leave us? It fits best with possible new type 1 diabetes starting to turn acidic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.67,
      "end_seconds": 274.33,
      "duration_seconds": 18.66,
      "text": "I'll request blood tests, it'll help with possible ketoacidosis let's book a finger-prick glucose and ketones to look into thirst and weight loss this is not flu, your sugar is very high, and you need hospital insulin today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.62,
      "end_seconds": 286.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.26,
      "text": "Ah. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. The diabetes team would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.07,
      "end_seconds": 289.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.27,
      "end_seconds": 299.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "if the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. See me again straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.05,
      "end_seconds": 304.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.0,
      "end_seconds": 308.29,
